{"description": "A collaborative web application (virtual office) presented as a 16-bit RPG video game", "homepage": "https://workadventu.re", "topics": ["hacktoberfest", "typescript", "workadventure", "remote", "workspace"], "pushed_at": "2026-11-13T20:38:01Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-13T18:49:53Z", "detail": {"avatar": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83825920?v=4", "license": null, "discussions_total": 12, "latest_release": {"name": "v1.34.5", "tag": "v1.34.5", "published_at": "2026-10-27T18:24:56Z", "body": "## Bug fix\r\n\r\n* fix(chat): let text messages through past the file transfer user limit by @moufmouf in https://github.com/workadventure/workadventure/pull/6857\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/workadventure/workadventure/compare/v1.34.4...v1.34.5", "is_prerelease": false}, "hot_issues": [{"number": 5825, "title": "WebSocket disconnects after login with Microsoft Entra ID on self-hosted Docker Compose deployment", "comments": 89, "created_at": "2026-03-08T05:33:56Z"}, {"number": 932, "title": "NETWORK ERROR when docker-compose up", "comments": 20, "created_at": "2021-04-23T11:31:57Z"}, {"number": 1632, "title": "Bubble doesn't work since last friday", "comments": 19, "created_at": "2021-12-07T13:34:56Z"}, {"number": 6197, "title": "Gravatar", "comments": 18, "created_at": "2026-06-08T13:40:01Z"}, {"number": 5579, "title": "Waiting for OIDC mock server to be up indefenitly", "comments": 17, "created_at": "2026-01-15T14:31:58Z"}, {"number": 3334, "title": "Jitsi problem after upgrading to 1.15.12", "comments": 14, "created_at": "2023-06-23T07:22:19Z"}, {"number": 3034, "title": "Where and how is \"Scripting API Extra\" initialized?", "comments": 13, "created_at": "2023-02-09T09:39:26Z"}, {"number": 1304, "title": "Feature Request: Being able to 'pin' a proximity chat so users can move their avatars as they talk", "comments": 13, "created_at": "2021-07-22T07:19:22Z"}], "discussions": [{"number": 6262, "title": "[HIRING] Lead Sales Consultant — Remote (Mountain Daylight Time)  ", "comments": 0, "category": "General", "created_at": "2026-06-22T13:08:15Z"}, {"number": 5971, "title": "Is it possible to use teams integration and self hosting? Paying for a sub/service is fine, just wondering if it's possible", "comments": 0, "category": "General", "created_at": "2026-04-13T15:46:05Z"}, {"number": 5676, "title": "Getting Started", "comments": 0, "category": "WorkAdventure’s Roadmap", "created_at": "2026-02-08T20:02:03Z"}, {"number": 5297, "title": "Background noise reduction in proximity chat?", "comments": 0, "category": "Ideas", "created_at": "2025-10-30T10:48:27Z"}, {"number": 5171, "title": "docker self-hosted + Google OpenID: has someone succeeded to configure it?", "comments": 0, "category": "General", "created_at": "2025-09-24T07:51:30Z"}, {"number": 5048, "title": "Deploy problem with chat", "comments": 0, "category": "WorkAdventure’s Roadmap", "created_at": "2025-08-25T13:10:24Z"}, {"number": 5008, "title": "deployment issue", "comments": 0, "category": "General", "created_at": "2025-08-05T20:54:25Z"}, {"number": 4352, "title": "[Workadventure] Jitsi | Call will disconnect after 5 minutes", "comments": 0, "category": "Q&A", "created_at": "2024-10-25T16:23:33Z"}], "readme": "![](https://github.com/thecodingmachine/workadventure/workflows/Continuous%20Integration/badge.svg) [![Discord](https://img.shields.io/discord/821338762134290432?label=Discord)](https://discord.gg/G6Xh9ZM9aR) ![Awesome](https://awesome.re/badge.svg)\n\n![WorkAdventure office image](README-MAP.png)\n\n# WorkAdventure\n\n\nWorkAdventure is a platform that allows you to design **fully customizable collaborative virtual worlds** (metaverse). \n\nWith your own avatar, you can **interact spontaneously** with your colleagues, clients, partners (using a **video-chat system**, triggered when you approach someone).\nImagine **all types of immersive experiences** (recruitments, onboarding, trainings, digital workplace, internal/external events) on desktop, mobile or tablet.\n\n_The little plus? The platform is **GDPR** and **open source**!_\n\n**See more features for your [virtual office](https://workadventu.re/virtual-offices/virtual-meetings/?utm_source=github)!**\n\n**Pricing for our [SaaS version](https://workadventu.re/pricing/?utm_source=github)!**\n\n\n[![Workadventure live demo example](https://workadventu.re/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Button-Live-Demo.png)](https://play.staging.workadventu.re/@/tcm/workadventure/wa-village/?utm_source=github)\n[![Workadventure Website](https://workadventu.re/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Button-Website.png)](https://workadventu.re/?utm_source=github)\n\n\n###### Support our team!\n[![Discord Logo](https://workadventu.re/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Icon-Discord.png)](https://discord.com/invite/G6Xh9ZM9aR)\n[![X Social Logo](https://workadventu.re/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Icon-X.png)](https://twitter.com/Workadventure_)\n[![LinkedIn Logo](https://workadventu.re/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Icon-LinkedIn.png)](https://www.linkedin.com/company/workadventu-re/)\n\n\n![Stats repo](https://github-readme-stats.vercel.app/api?username={username}&theme=transparent)\n\n\n\n## Contributors\n\nThanks to everyone who contributes to WorkAdventure!\n\n<!-- contributors:start -->\n<a href=\"https://github.com/moufmouf\"><img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1290952?v=4&amp;s=48\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" alt=\"moufmouf\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/gparant\"><img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23724509?v=4&amp;s=48\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" alt=\"gparant\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Waclaw-I\"><img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14911927?v=4&amp;s=48\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" alt=\"Waclaw-I\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Kharhamel\"><img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10496706?v=4&amp;s=48\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" alt=\"Kharhamel\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/nolway\"><img src=\"ht